# Icon embeds app.ico into the executable: RiftBuild generates an icon .rc,
# runs the resource compiler, and links the .res in. The value is the icon
# file's name relative to this folder (extension optional).
# NOTE: absolute Windows paths do not work here - backslashes are treated as
# escape characters by the parser - so keep the icon next to the build file.
Icon app
